# p5 usage (v0.0.16 only): the budget table (member-only in real use) from a seeded cache already on disk for the
# harness's fake key (scope api_key, identity sha256 of
# "fx-usage-cache-v1\\0api_key\\0fake-key-not-real\\0", src/usage/cache.zig:25-35@481104fd),
# written for today's UTC day by p5-usage-mkcache.py (rerun it on another UTC day); the open's fetch gets 404. Table,
# selection, detail screen, next model, periods, r.
fx: homefile .fx/usage-cache/c5482018bc3612f715c33c5a278e44485d3bc741118d70cfeff2c0aa3f94fc4e.json p5-usage-cache-budget.json
models models.json
wait 2.5
type /usage
key Enter
wait 3
snap open
key Down
wait 0.5
snap down
key Enter
wait 0.7
snap detail
key Down
wait 0.5
snap detail-down
key Tab
wait 0.5
snap detail-tab
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap back
key Tab
wait 0.7
snap tab-today
key Tab
wait 0.7
snap tab-7d
key Right
wait 0.7
snap right-month
key Left
wait 0.7
snap left-7d
key r
wait 2
snap r
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap closed
home end
gwlog
